OL,3,GNEWSAHistory buffs create 'Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry' of village
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They really show what life's been like
OL,7,Fover the past few hundred years," said
OL,8,FChris Garrod, of the Hockham History
OL,9,Fgroup.
